## Sign-in

The users sign in on `/sign-in` with a user name and a password. Set
`AUTH_SECRET` to a long random text. With `SEED_PASSWORD`, the seed
gives each seed user this password.
{% if definition.auth.sign_up %}
New users make an account on `/sign-up`.
{% endif %}
{% if definition.auth.password_reset %}
A user who forgets the password asks for a reset link on
`/forgot-password`. The link opens `/reset-password`, and is valid for
{{ definition.auth.password_reset.token_minutes }} minutes and one time. Write the delivery of the link (for
example an email) in `src/shared/auth/password-reset.ext.ts`. Until
then, with `ENVIRONMENT=development`, the app writes the link to the
log. Set `PUBLIC_URL` to the URL of the app for the browsers: the links
use it.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

